面暗中掉左车抢占要道。现平车求兑妙手，后伏杀机。黑方顺手车6平7吃马，显系失察，铸成大错，应车6进2尚可一战。","text":"    红方一面顺佯敌意，造成车马被牵的表象，一面暗中掉左车抢占要道。现平车求兑妙手，后伏杀机。黑方顺手车6平7吃马，显系失察，铸成大错，应车6进2尚可一战。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":32,"anchor_node_id":"0:32","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment33:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment33","raw_text":"    红弃左肋车叫将，绝妙的入局手段，十分凶悍，是速胜的精华。","text":"    红弃左肋车叫将，绝妙的入局手段，十分凶悍，是速胜的精华。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":33,"anchor_node_id":"0:33","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment35:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment35","raw_text":"    黑见大势已去，遂认负，推演如下。","text":"    黑见大势已去，遂认负，推演如下。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":35,"anchor_node_id":"0:35","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment37:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment37","raw_text":"    如果炮五平六，则车7进4，解杀。","text":"    如果炮五平六，则车7进4，解杀。","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":37,"anchor_node_id":"0:37","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false},{"id":"DhtmlXQ_comment43:0","source_tag":"DhtmlXQ_comment43","raw_text":"    绝杀，红胜。||","text":"    绝杀，红胜。\n","source_line_id":"0","source_after_ply":43,"anchor_node_id":"0:43","status":"attached","conflicting_field":false}],"issues":[],"metadata":{"DhtmlXQ_init":["500,350"],"DhtmlXQ_title":["河北阎文清 先胜 北京张强"],"DhtmlXQ_event":["第二章 顺手炮、列手炮(32局)"],"DhtmlXQ_blackteam":[""],"DhtmlXQ_blackrating":[""],"DhtmlXQ_result":["未知"],"DhtmlXQ_open":["D43 中炮对左三步虎转列炮"],"DhtmlXQ_remark":[""],"DhtmlXQ_author":[""],"DhtmlXQ_binit":["0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383"],"DhtmlXQ_type":["实战全局/开局"]},"source_tag_count":20,"identical_tag_duplicates":0,"binit":"0919293949596979891777062646668600102030405060708012720323436383","side_to_move":"w","side_basis":"color of first source mover at binit square","standard_start":true,"summary":{"lines":1,"structured_branches":0,"line_statuses":{"legal":1},"source_move_records":43,"legal_move_records":43,"annotations":8,"annotation_statuses":